{
  "adapter": "Apple M3 Pro",
  "software_emulated": false,
  "profile": "bench optimized",
  "target_pixels": [
    256,
    256
  ],
  "render_measurement": "CPU scene submission plus GPU completion wait; no pixel readback; not isolated GPU execution time",
  "default_sample_size": 10,
  "default_warm_up_seconds": 1,
  "default_measurement_seconds": 1,
  "exceptions": {
    "paint_graph/function_*": {
      "samples": 20,
      "measurement_seconds": 2
    },
    "paint_canvas/update_64": {
      "samples": 20,
      "measurement_seconds": 3
    }
  },
  "notes": [
    "First cold graph root recreated each iteration; retained and dropped rebuild use same root.",
    "Cold shared64 excludes adapter/device setup via iter_batched; includes first paint pipeline compile and target allocation.",
    "All warm scenes rendered twice before timing; assertions verify no additional paint pipeline compilation.",
    "Distinct roots intentionally defeat root program sharing even with the same WGSL source.",
    "Initial release run preceded inactive cache pruning improvement; focused updates included pruning.",
    "No absolute zero overhead or cross-hardware claim; short runs have visible outliers."
  ],
